{"unit_id":"wjw0419__-deadline-pulse#card-zh","repo":"wjw0419/-deadline-pulse","commit":"6e130c6fd978a3e722a3a62cee21052aa82cbaed","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Deadline Pulse（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在 DSH 会话标题栏显示截止日期倒计时胶囊，并提供可展开的截止事项面板。它注册 deadline_tool 和 Web API，让代理或面板新增、查看、完成、删除及调整截止日期。面板显示剩余时间、标签、备注和进度，并支持按准备工时检测冲突、显示临期提示与启动提醒。适合希望在 DSH 会话中持续跟踪多个任务期限的用户。数据保存在用户主目录下的本地文件，并由各会话共享；不需要额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:154-164","index.js:406-408","client.js:502-520","client.js:967-1048"]}
{"unit_id":"wjw0419__-deadline-pulse#card-en","repo":"wjw0419/-deadline-pulse","commit":"6e130c6fd978a3e722a3a62cee21052aa82cbaed","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Deadline Pulse adds countdowns to the DSH web conversation header. Users or an agent can add, list, complete, remove, and reschedule deadlines. It shows progress, detects schedule conflicts by estimated effort, and displays alerts. Data is stored locally and shared across sessions.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:154-164","index.js:406-408","client.js:502-520","client.js:967-1048"]}
