{"unit_id":"wjw0419__-deadline-pulse#feature-1","repo":"wjw0419/-deadline-pulse","commit":"6e130c6fd978a3e722a3a62cee21052aa82cbaed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Deadline Pulse 的功能「倒计时与临期显示」：会话标题栏按剩余时间显示截止日期胶囊，倒计时每秒刷新；不同临期区间使用不同状态，并在跨过阈值时弹出提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:447-475","client.js:582-620"]}
{"unit_id":"wjw0419__-deadline-pulse#feature-2","repo":"wjw0419/-deadline-pulse","commit":"6e130c6fd978a3e722a3a62cee21052aa82cbaed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Deadline Pulse 的功能「截止事项管理」：代理可通过 deadline_tool 新增、列出、标记完成或删除事项；记录包含标题和截止时间，也可附带标签、备注与预估工时。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:154-189","index.js:215-283"]}
{"unit_id":"wjw0419__-deadline-pulse#feature-3","repo":"wjw0419/-deadline-pulse","commit":"6e130c6fd978a3e722a3a62cee21052aa82cbaed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Deadline Pulse 的功能「冲突检测」：面板或代理可检查未完成事项的准备时间窗口是否重叠，并按同日到期与重叠时长返回冲突等级。未填写工时按两小时估算。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:285-367"]}
{"unit_id":"wjw0419__-deadline-pulse#feature-4","repo":"wjw0419/-deadline-pulse","commit":"6e130c6fd978a3e722a3a62cee21052aa82cbaed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Deadline Pulse 的功能「改期与工时调整」：用户可在冲突结果或事项面板调整某项截止时间，也可更新预估工时；提交后保存记录并刷新显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:370-397","client.js:720-748"]}
{"unit_id":"wjw0419__-deadline-pulse#feature-5","repo":"wjw0419/-deadline-pulse","commit":"6e130c6fd978a3e722a3a62cee21052aa82cbaed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Deadline Pulse 的功能「临近事项启动提醒」：成功加载数据后，若有七天内到期的未完成事项，页面显示提醒弹窗；提醒可最小化为徽标。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:556-562","client.js:1013-1060"]}
{"unit_id":"wjw0419__-deadline-pulse#caveat-1","repo":"wjw0419/-deadline-pulse","commit":"6e130c6fd978a3e722a3a62cee21052aa82cbaed","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Deadline Pulse 将事项写入用户主目录下的 .dsh/deadline-pulse/deadlines.json，并由所有 DSH 会话共用；手动编辑该文件也会同步到面板。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:25-33","index.js:114-120","client.js:572-580"]}
